    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于上升时间约为 1 秒（从而闭环带宽约为 0.5 赫兹）的系统，要求 10 至 20 赫兹的采样率是合理的，即为 ω_BW 的 20 至 40 倍。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For a system with a rise time on the order of 1 sec (thus yielding a closed-loop bandwidth on the order of 0.5 Hertz), it is reasonable to insist on a sampling rate of 10 to 20 Hertz, which is a factor of 20 to 40 times ω_BW.",
